On November 17, 2026, amendment 0001 to&nbsp;solicitation 1240BH27Q0001 - GAOA Star Meadows MEP Repairs Utility Installations Flathead National Forest has been posted to SAM.gov and accomplished the following: 

1. Post responses to RFIs received labeled &quot;C05a RFI Response 1240BH27Q0001.&quot; 

2. Post revised specifications labeled &quot;C05b Updated Specifications.&quot; 

3. Post revised SOI labeled &quot;C05c Updated SOI 1240BH27Q0001.&quot; 

4. Post asbestos report labeled &quot;C05d Star Meadow Cabin Asbestos Report.&quot; 

5. Post site visit sign in sheet labeled &ldquo;C05e Star Meadows Site Visit.&quot; 

This amendment must be acknowledged and submitted with your quote. 

************************************************************************************************************************************************ 

Work includes complete operational assembly of Hydronic Heating, Air Heating and Distribution, Propane Service, Propane Fireplaces, Water Supply, and Sewer Drain.&nbsp;
